  "title": "Lattice Wins 2026 Cybersecurity Stars Award by The Hacker News",
  "summary": "HILLSBORO, Ore. --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Jul. 1, 2026-- Lattice Semiconductor (NASDAQ: LSCC), the low power programmable leader, today announced that its Lattice MachXO5™-NX TDQ FPGA family won a 2026 Cybersecurity Stars Award, hosted by The Hacker News, in the “Best Post-Quantum Cryptography” category.",
